  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "LLM boundary",
      "items": [
        "Every step, ToyAgent.step calls LLM.chat once; LLM.chat calls self.client.messages.create and parses the reply into text + tool calls",
        "llm_query before the call, llm_response with the parsed actions after, llm_error (then re-raised) if the call throws",
        "On TimeoutError, step retries once via fallback_query, which calls LLM.chat with no tools"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "tool boundary",
      "items": [
        "Registry.run dispatches each tool call by name to bash (subprocess.run) or python (exec)",
        "tool_start before running it, tool_end with the result, tool_error (then re-raised) if it throws",
        "Tool results are collected into one results_message and appended to messages for the next step"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "observation points",
      "items": [
        "agent.py: tool_start/tool_end log the incoming task itself (28-29) and every ask_user prompt/answer (52, 54)",
        "tools.py: tool_start/tool_error/tool_end wrap Registry.run (23, 27, 29)",
        "llm.py: llm_query/llm_error/llm_response wrap LLM.chat (15, 25, 28)"
      ]
    }
  ]
